<title>USA: Dynasty TMT sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Dynasty TMT sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynasty TMT Corp on Tuesday said it will set a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>In a release, the Vancouver-based firm said the split was effective immediately, but gave no details on when the stock will be distributed.</p>
</text>
